{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "40f9bfb6-7df1-83d5-99d7-f3a18508ffb0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T12:49:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin. Marco Grasso. I'm calling about water in my yard. Again, I guess I'd say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, water in the yard. Where are you located, Mr. Grasso?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:46:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighty Callender Avenue, up the North End. It's from last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. Whole yard was a pond till Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighty Callender, got it. Is this water coming off the street, or is it more like a drain backing up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Neither, really. It runs down the hill from the next street over and goes straight into my yard. Like it's got an appointment. Nothing stops it on the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so runoff coming downhill, collecting at your place. Did it get into the house at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, house stayed dry this time. Just the yard and the side of the garage. But it's a mess. Mud everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And has this happened before, or was this one new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The neighbor says it happens every big rain. Been that way for years, according to him. So it's not exactly news, except to whoever's supposed to be dealing with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. I'm writing this down. Eighty Callender Avenue, runoff from the next street uphill, pooling in the yard and by the garage, recurring. Is there a catch basin up there that you know of, or are you not sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I couldn't tell you. There might be one at the corner, but it's usually full of leaves or snow or both. I haven't gone up to look. I've been busy with a shovel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll put in a request so somebody can go look at the drainage up there and at your property line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:48:45-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I ask, do the crews work on weekends? Because the people next door are moving out this weekend, and I'd like somebody to see it while there's still a witness. Well, a second one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:00-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews do get called out on weekends for emergencies, mostly. For something like this, a drainage check, it'd more likely be a weekday. I can't promise a day, though. They're backed up after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. They're always backed up. That part I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that the neighbor's leaving, and that you'd like somebody out soon. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight oh. Got it. Somebody from the department should call you back, or stop by and look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll believe it when I see a truck, but thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Take care, Mr. Grasso."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T12:49:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
